ildren":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱，但要跑几个窗口。去之前备齐死亡证明和亲属关系证明。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["住房公积金账户余额（他公积金账户里还剩的钱），继承人、受遗赠人可以提取。受遗赠人是指写进遗嘱、要把东西留给他的那个人。因工死亡的，另有三笔钱：丧葬补助金、供养亲属抚恤金、一次性工亡补助金。养老保险个人账户里剩的钱，社会保险法写明可以继承。参加职工养老保险的人因病或者非因工死亡，家属还能领丧葬补助金和抚恤金，合称遗属待遇。企业职工的标准按全国统一的公式算。丧葬补助金是本省上一年城镇居民月人均可支配收入的 2 倍。抚恤金也以这笔月人均收入为基数，按缴费年限发 3 到 24 个月。不满 5 年发 3 个月，5 到 10 年 6 个月，10 到 15 年 9 个月，15 年以上每多 1 年加 1 个月，最多 24 个月。已经退休的，每领 1 年养老金减 1 个月，最少 9 个月"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国务院 (2026). 住房公积金管理条例（国务院令第 844 号修改，2026 年 9 月 20 日起施行）第二十四条末款. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2026/issue_12946/202608/content_7079363.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2026/issue_12946/202608/content_7079363.html"]},"：「职工死亡或者被宣告死亡的，职工的继承人、受遗赠人可以提取职工住房公积金账户内的存储余额；无继承人也无受遗赠人的，职工住房公积金账户内的存储余额纳入住房公积金的增值收益。」；工伤保险条例第三十九条的三笔待遇见第 19 节. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2011/content_1778064.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2011/content_1778064.htm"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2018 修正). 社会保险法（第十四、十七条）：「个人死亡的，个人账户余额可以继承」「参加基本养老保险的个人，因病或者非因工死亡的，其遗属可以领取丧葬补助金和抚恤金」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8080816f135f46016f210989b9179a","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8080816f135f46016f210989b9179a"]},"（国家法律法规数据库）；人力资源社会保障部、财政部 (2021). 企业职工基本养老保险遗属待遇暂行办法（人社部发〔2021〕18 号，2021 年 9 月 1 日起施行，第四、五条），原件未公开挂网，条文按广州市花都区人民政府行政复议决定书（花都府行复〔2022〕226 号）的逐字引用核对：「丧葬补助金的标准，按照参保人员死亡时本省……上一年度城镇居民月人均可支配收入的2倍计算」「缴费年限不满5年的，发放月数为3个月……缴费年限30年以上的，按照30年计算，发放月数最高为24个月」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.huadu.gov.cn/xxgk/xzfy/content/post_8672730.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.huadu.gov.cn/xxgk/xzfy/content/post_8672730.html"]},"；福建省人力资源和社会保障厅. 常见问题：「每领取1年基本养老金减少1个月，发放月数最低为9个月」「累计缴费年限不足5年的，其遗属待遇（含丧葬补助金和抚恤金）标准不得超过其个人缴费之和」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://rst.fujian.gov.cn/wz/cjwt/czzgly/202311/t20231113_6294929.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://rst.fujian.gov.cn/wz/cjwt/czzgly/202311/t20231113_6294929.htm"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["公积金那笔最常被忘掉，因为它不在银行账户里，也不会自动进遗产分配。养老保险个人账户里剩的钱和遗属待遇是分开算、分开发的，要去参保地的社保经办窗口一起办。各地要的材料不一样。缴费不满 5 年的，遗属待遇合起来不超过他自己交的钱。这套公式出自企业职工养老保险的办法，机关事业单位和城乡居民养老保险的遗属待遇去窗口问。丧葬费、抚恤金打进了他的银行账户，取法见第 12 条（存款直接去银行取）。遗嘱和继承的形式要求见第 17 节。打算放弃继承来躲债的，先别去取这些钱，见第 11 条（书面声明放弃继承）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/25-08"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"殡葬代理、用品代购、策划主持这类中介，要在县级民政备案"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/25-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"死者的账号和个人信息，近亲属可以要求查阅、复制、更正、删除"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","str